00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,150
Fifty-two cards. Three to six players. No jokers.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,798
Zheng Shangyou. Climb from downstream to upstream.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,798
Lead a single, pair, triple, road or bomb. Beat it with a bigger set.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,174
Two passes clear the trick. The last player to play leads again.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:29,706
Finish first for upstream. Last place is downstream, and the points follow.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,990
Next round, downstream pays tribute and upstream returns any card.

